    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n29829" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">mulgĕo</span></b> , si, sum or ctum,
		2, v. a.
		Sanscr marǵ, wipe or rub away; Gr. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ-μέλγω</span>; Germ. melken; Engl.
		milk, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>to
				milk</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">oves,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg. E.
					3, 5</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">capras,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					10, 39, 56, § 115</span></i>
			.—<b>
				<i>Absol.</i>
			</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">mulgent ad caseum faciendum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Varr. R. R. 2, 11, 4</span></i>
			.—Prov.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">mulgere hircos, of something impossible,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					E. 3, 91</span></i>
			.</div>
